sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Editor client
    participant LS as adoc-ls<br/>protocol.rs
    participant Engine as adoc-engine
    Client->>LS: didOpen, didChange
    LS->>Engine: open_client_text, edit.replace_range
    Engine-->>Engine: index and diagnose after typing pauses
    LS->>Engine: pump when idle for 50 ms
    Engine-->>LS: DiagnosticsUpdated
    LS-->>Client: publishDiagnostics
    Client->>LS: definition, hover, completion
    LS->>Engine: query
    Engine-->>LS: result on byte offsets
    LS-->>Client: lsp-types response
